findings.proposed_change:
overlay.html .drop: delete the 3 `filter: drop-shadow(...)` lines. .media-box: add
  /* Ombre peinte une seule fois dans le calque du drop (au lieu d'un filtre
     recalculé à chaque image du flottement en rendu logiciel). Rayons ~x2
     pour garder le rendu des anciens drop-shadow. */
  border-radius: 14px;
  box-shadow: 0 30px 140px rgba(0,0,0,.55), 0 6px 28px rgba(0,0,0,.4);
Radii fitted against screenshots of the current rendering (130/26..150/30 all close, 140/28 best). img/video/svg keep their own 14px radius and #000 background, so the silhouette is the same rounded rect; avatar, close button and react bar already carry their own box-shadows. Option if a slightly tighter shadow is acceptable: the literal 60px/12px values cut the remaining per-frame cost further (measured 385 vs 568 ms CPU/s).

Replace spotlightRAF/tickSpotlight by:
let spotlightKey = '';
const spotlightRO = typeof ResizeObserver === 'function' ? new ResizeObserver(() => updateSpotlight()) : null;
// Géométrie de mise en page : suit chargement/drag/resize, pas le flottement
function updateSpotlight() {
  const anchor = spotlightStack.find(a => a.isConnected);
  if (!anchor) { spotlightEl.style.opacity = '0'; return; }
  const drop = anchor.querySelector('.drop'); if (!drop) return;
  const cx = anchor.offsetLeft, cy = anchor.offsetTop;
  const rx = drop.offsetWidth / 2 + 70, ry = drop.offsetHeight / 2 + 70;
  const key = `${cx}|${cy}|${rx}|${ry}`; if (key === spotlightKey) return;
  spotlightKey = key; /* same 4 setProperty as today */ }
showSpotlight: unshift; spotlightRO?.observe(drop); updateSpotlight(); opacity '1'.
hideSpotlight: if (idx < 0) return; splice; spotlightRO?.unobserve(drop); updateSpotlight();
Add `if (spotlightStack.length) updateSpotlight();` after the drag writes (l.92), at the end of __mdDropCtl.move (l.194) and in a window 'resize' listener. Live disable (l.904-907): `spotlightStack.length = 0; spotlightRO?.disconnect();` instead of cancelAnimationFrame (also stops a stale stack re-lighting an older drop).

